msgid ""
"Are you sure you want to clear the monitor database? All collected metrics "
"will be permanently deleted."
msgstr ""
"Vill du verkligen rensa övervakningsdatabasen? Alla insamlade mätvärden tas "
"bort permanent."

msgid "Are you sure you want to delete all snapshots?"
msgstr "Vill du verkligen ta bort alla ögonblicksbilder?"

msgid ""
"Are you sure you want to delete this backup? For an incremental backup this "
"removes the entire chain (the full backup and all of its incrementals), "
"since they cannot be restored without it."
msgstr ""
"Vill du verkligen ta bort den här säkerhetskopian? För en inkrementell "
"säkerhetskopia tas hela kedjan bort, det vill säga den fullständiga "
"säkerhetskopian och alla dess inkrement, eftersom de inte kan återställas "
"utan den."

